From: Alex Perrin <44126061+AlexPerrin@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 16:32:43 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] feat: 20 more Lumbridge & Draynor / Varrock achievement diary
 task hooks

Hooks in existing content: pickpocketing (a man or woman in Lumbridge, Martin), fishing
(anchovies in Al Kharid, salmon in Lumbridge, trout at Barbarian Village), willow logs in
Draynor, iron in the south-east Varrock mine, cave bug and Draynor Sewers zombie kills
(NpcDeathKillHook), a coif in the Lumbridge cow pen, a bowl spun and fired in Barbarian
Village, Thessalia's store, the Stronghold of Security's second level and its four emotes,
Chaeldar and Vannaka tasks, picking a kitten colour, 20 mahogany planks at once, and the Waka
canoe (Lumbridge to Edgeville; shaped at Edgeville). Area boxes are approximate.
